Package: pops-agent
Version: @DEB_VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: PashaCore <security@pashacore.com.tr>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-websockets (>= 10), python3-cryptography
Recommends: systemd
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/PashaCore/POps
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Description: POps agent for school lab PCs (Linux)
 Connects the PC to a POps server over TLS: hardware and package inventory,
 remote commands run as root (can be switched off on the PC) and signed
 self-updates. Screen view, quarantine and the tray are not part of this
 version.
